#X text 765 21 >3) From an answer to a question on r/pureata: ---------------------------------------------------------- Just click the [bang] repeatedly and it will count up from 0 to 9 and then reset to 0;
#X text 571 305 >4) Here is another answer in text form that I will try to build and see if that works too. --------------------------- Ok…if you want an easy counter that goes 0…10 0…10 and cycles that \, here’s what you do (you have the right idea \, btw): bang - [f] - [+ 1] Now \, from that [+ 1] \, feed back into the [f] COLD inlet. That’s your basic counter. Come out from that [f] and do this: [f] - [mod 11] - [number atom] ----------------------------------------------------------->;
